<title>BELGIUM: Spector to launch Internet photo album.</title>
<headline>Spector to launch Internet photo album.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian photo processing group Spector NV will this month launch a product to build secure photo albums on the Internet, the company said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The product, called Photoweb, allows pictures to be seen throughout the world by anyone who has been given a password by the album owner, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Spector President Johan Mussche would unveil the product at a news conference in Ghent on December 20, it said.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
